            "lines": [
              "# 1.18.6",
              "",
              "A sound modding update: replacement sounds can now keep the volume you set for them.",
              "",
              "## Sounds",
              "- **Your own volume for replacement sounds.** A file listed in `sound-levels.txt` now keeps its own loudness instead (it is only turned down if it would clip).",
              "- **Sound editor (for modders and the developer):** `tools/sound_editor` builds a local page to hear every pack's sounds and every voice line."
            ]
          },
          {
            "version": "1.18.5",
            "mtime": "2026-10-24T04:01:11Z",
            "lines": [
              "# 1.18.5",
              "",
              "A client performance and polish update: smoother frames, fewer stutters, faster map loads, and a batch of fixes.",
              "",
              "## Loading",
              "- **The official maps ship with their lighting already baked.** Midtown 5.3 s -> 0.05 s, Lodestone 2.8 s -> 0.04 s.",
              "- **Cached map loads are about 2.5x faster** (the light bake's preparation runs on every core)."
            ]
          },
          {
            "version": "1.18.4",
            "mtime": "2026-10-22T23:40:00Z",
            "lines": [
              "# 1.18.4",
              "",
              "A small server fix. Network protocol unchanged (42).",
              "",
              "## Servers",
              "- A big reliable message, such as a long chat line, a ranked ticket or a map edit, can no longer get stuck waiting while a crowded snapshot has no room for it."
            ]
          },
